One tab bar in the project dialog, matching the previous system (1.10.1)

1.10.0 nested two tab bars: an outer basics/settings pair plus an inner
team/tasks/QA/files bar inside the bootstrap sections. The previous system
has a single nav — Info | Tasks | Files | QA — and everything about the
project, its team included, lives under Info.

Flattened to exactly that. The team section moved into the Info panel,
where it belongs: a project's team is part of its identity, not a later
step. The three bootstrap panels stay mounted and are only hidden, so
their inputs still reach FormData.

The three extra tabs appear only while creating; editing shows Info alone,
since members and tasks are managed from their own sections afterwards.

